lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a social activity with friends, Sophie tries to maintain a joyful atmosphere in the group, but her friend Tom starts to share some old stories, making everyone feel uncomfortable. Sophie picks up a corn cob and starts eating, looking at Tom and saying, \"Tom, the corn cob is really delicious, you should try it too!\"\n\n[Question]\nWhat does Sophie really want to say when she says this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Sophie hopes Tom stops sharing things that make everyone feel uncomfortable.\nB. Sophie thinks Tom should pay attention to his diet.\nC. Sophie wants to invite Tom to enjoy a pleasant meal time together.\nD. Sophie hopes Tom tries the corn cob.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0013249974530752514,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52af1c2ddb05a7fe2f403","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452209696,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:56:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"a50da0c90f4e434b8782dad509bc1a40"}